## Overview

{{ project_name }} is an Electric Power Steering system providing torque assist,
position control, and return-to-center. Built on NXP {{ mcu }} with ASIL {{ asil_label }}.

## Key Features
- **Torque Assist**: Speed-dependent boost curve, FOC motor control
- **Dual TAS Sensors**: Two redundant torque-angle sensors
- **Return-to-Center**: Speed-adaptive, 2 second return at low speed
- **Active Damping**: Steering oscillation suppression at high speed
- **Safety**: ASIL D dual-path torque monitoring, windowed watchdog

